#. Translators: Summary/title for this add-on
#. to be shown on installation and add-on information found in add-on store
#: addon/globalPlugins/accesifyPlay/__init__.py:73
#: addon/globalPlugins/accesifyPlay/dialogs/settings.py:21 buildVars.py:21
msgid "Accessify Play"
msgstr "Accessify Play"

#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information
#. from add-on store
#: buildVars.py:24
msgid ""
"Accessify Play provides comprehensive NVDA control for Spotify playback on "
"any Connect-enabled device. A Spotify Premium subscription is required for "
"full functionality."
msgstr ""
"Accessify Play memberikan kontrol NVDA komprehensif untuk pemutaran Spotify "
"di perangkat apa pun yang mendukung Spotify Connect. Langganan Spotify "
"Premium diperlukan untuk fungsionalitas penuh."

#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the
#. add-on store
#: buildVars.py:29
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"- 1.11.1: reach a podcast's full episode list from a saved episode, and "
"\"View Episodes\" for podcasts in search.\n"
"- Saved Episodes and Saved Audiobooks: save individual podcast episodes and "
"audiobooks, and find them in two new Library tabs.\n"
"- One command to save or unsave episodes, shows and audiobooks, like "
"Like/Unlike does for tracks.\n"
"- Remove Duplicates and Clear Playlist, in the Library's Manage Playlists "
"tab.\n"
"- Show Lyrics for any song in a list without playing it (Alt+W in Search).\n"
"- Follow or unfollow the owner of any playlist, and open audiobook, chapter "
"and user links in Play from URL.\n"
"- Fixed removing a track deleting every copy of it from a playlist; now only"
" the selected copy is removed.\n"
"- Fixed moving a track up or down sometimes moving a different track in "
"playlists containing unavailable songs.\n"
"- Fixed commands failing silently when not logged in to Spotify.\n"
"- Fixed synced lyrics being mistimed, dropped, or read with a timestamp "
"spoken aloud.\n"
"- More reliable updates: downloads time out, and a failed update can be "
"retried.\n"
"- Manage Playlists now always shows the playlist you select, and Refresh "
"keeps your place.\n"
"- The Library (M) opens instantly and loads each tab only when you open it. "
"Features Spotify retires now say so clearly.\n"
"- Saving and following moved to Spotify's current library service, ahead of "
"the old one being switched off.\n"
"- 58% smaller libraries, with no .exe or compiled files, so it works the "
"same on 32-bit and 64-bit NVDA.\n"
"- No longer interferes with other add-ons that use Python's secrets module.\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""

